    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_column_1",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Welcome to our shop! We're passionate about creating high-quality products that bring joy to your everyday life. Our journey began with a simple idea: to craft items that combine functionality with beautiful design. Every product in our collection is carefully selected and tested to ensure it meets our high standards.</p><p>We believe in sustainable practices and ethical sourcing. Our commitment to the environment drives us to work with suppliers who share our values. When you shop with us, you're not just buying a product – you're supporting a movement towards more conscious consumption.</p>"
